<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="CGF1_MWP_ATLauncher_T1">
		<defName>CGF1_MWP_Type70_RocketLauncher_</defName>
		<label>Type 70 Rocket Launcher</label>
		<description>Caliber: 62mm Type 70. 1-round tube. Single-Shot.
		
The Type 70 is a Chinese anti-tank rocket launcher developed in the 1970s, possibly inspired by the American M72 LAW. The Type 70 was introduced to supplement the Type 69 (a copy of the Soviet RPG-7), but was not successful in this role and only saw limited use before likely being phased out. However, the system would go onto be reused in the design of the later FHJ-84 incendiary launcher, which remains in use to this day.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>CGF1/Gun/Type70_RocketLauncher</texPath>
			<drawSize>1.05</drawSize>
		</graphicData>
		<tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers>
				<li>CGF1_MWP_Building_Gunsmith</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisite>CGF1_MWP_Research_T9_SpaceAgeFirearms</researchPrerequisite>
			<skillRequirements>
				<Crafting>5</Crafting>
			</skillRequirements>
		</recipeMaker>
		<costList>
			<Steel>60</Steel>
			<ComponentIndustrial>12</ComponentIndustrial>
		</costList>
		<statBases>
			<WorkToMake>45000</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>5.5</Mass>
			<RangedWeapon_Cooldown>4.5</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
		</statBases>
		<equippedAngleOffset>40</equippedAngleOffset>
		<weaponTags>
			<li>CGF1_Launcher_Military</li>
		</weaponTags>
		<weaponClasses>
			<li>RangedHeavy</li>
		</weaponClasses>
		<tradeTags>
			<li>CGF1_GunsGalore_ColdWarChinaVietnam</li>
			<li>CGF1_GunsGalore_ColdWarChinaVietnam_Launcher</li>
